    "body": "This is a problematic feature: taking a screenshot of an element is something that should not require user consent: after all, the API would be triggered by its own page\n\nOn the other hand, I believe being able to capture tainted `canvas`es and crossorigin iframes should not be allowed even by user consent: the user is likely not aware of what parts of the page are tainted or iframed: their consent is mostly meaningless",
